<view class="health-page {{darkMode ? 'dark' : ''}}">
  <view class="navbar" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="nav-back" bindtap="onBack">
      <t-icon name="chevron-left" size="44rpx" color="{{darkMode ? '#D8D8D8' : '#333'}}" />
    </view>
    <view class="nav-title-wrap">
      <text class="nav-title">云开发自检</text>
      <text class="nav-subtitle">共享 CloudBase 连通性</text>
    </view>
    <view class="nav-refresh" bindtap="onRefresh">
      <t-icon name="refresh" size="38rpx" color="{{darkMode ? '#F4B75A' : '#E9921B'}}" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="health-scroll" scroll-y>
    <view class="health-content">
      <view class="summary-panel summary-panel--{{report.status}}">
        <view class="summary-icon">
          <t-icon name="{{summaryIcon}}" size="56rpx" color="{{summaryColor}}" />
        </view>
        <view class="summary-copy">
          <view class="summary-title-row">
            <text class="summary-title">{{report.summary}}</text>
            <t-tag theme="{{summaryTagTheme}}" variant="light" size="small">{{summaryStatusText}}</t-tag>
          </view>
          <text class="summary-desc">{{report.envLabel}}</text>
          <text class="summary-time">检测时间：{{report.checkedAt || '未检测'}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="action-row">
        <t-button theme="primary" size="small" icon="refresh" loading="{{checking}}" bind:tap="onRefresh">
          重新自检
        </t-button>
        <t-button theme="default" variant="outline" size="small" icon="copy" bind:tap="onCopyReport">
          复制报告
        </t-button>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{checking && steps.length === 0}}" class="state-card">
        <t-icon name="loading" size="48rpx" color="#E9921B" />
        <text class="state-title">正在检查云开发链路</text>
        <text class="state-desc">会依次检查 SDK、云登录、活跃酒局读取和临时写入清理。</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:else class="step-list">
        <view
          class="step-card step-card--{{item.status}}"
          wx:for="{{steps}}"
          wx:key="key"
        >
          <view class="step-head">
            <view class="step-head-left">
              <view class="step-icon">
                <t-icon name="{{item.icon}}" size="42rpx" color="{{item.color}}" />
              </view>
              <text class="step-title">{{item.title}}</text>
            </view>
            <t-tag theme="{{item.tagTheme}}" variant="light" size="small">{{item.statusText}}</t-tag>
          </view>
          <text class="step-message">{{item.message}}</text>
          <view class="step-advice">
            <text class="step-label">处理建议</text>
            <text class="step-advice-text">{{item.advice}}</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.detail}}" class="step-detail">
            <text class="step-label">调试详情</text>
            <text class="step-detail-text">{{item.detail}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="notice-card">
        <text class="notice-title">说明</text>
        <text class="notice-text">入口隐藏在首页标题区域长按，普通用户不会看到。自检写入的是 cloud-self-check 临时酒局，云函数会按文档 ID 清理，不会放弃或覆盖真实酒局。</text>
        <text class="notice-text">如果出现未授权，请在资源方 CloudBase 控制台确认环境共享授权；如果出现函数不存在或 UNKNOWN_ACTION，请重新部署对应云函数。</text>
      </view>

      <view class="bottom-safe-space"></view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
